nd technical information. Willingness to learn SAP functionality and assist with system troubleshooting and user support. Ability to research potential solutions and learn AI and automation tools, including Microsoft Copilot. Additional Information Work is done on site at Textron Aviation West Campus. Physical Requirements Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information Apply Now First Name (required) c3ce6a4d Last Name (required) 2043057c Email (required) 943462fc Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) ee6e7cfc Last Name (required) b489e74c Email (required) 0ae09bdf Job Alert 89bad805 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Temporary Temporary Department(s) Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With Someone Else! First Name (required) b39110a5 Last Name (required) 3be49b59 Email (required) 3d903161 Send This Job To: c53532ec Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you