      "description": "Textron Aviation SAP Business Systems Analyst Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States Textron Aviation SAP Business Systems Analyst Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode Textron Aviation SAP Business Systems Analyst Student Assistant Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm | Student Textron Aviation SAP Business Systems Analyst Student Assistant 499814 Student Department Ennovar Campus Location Wichita, KS - Other Wichita Location Hire Type Part Time Pay $15 - 18 per hour Work Schedule ; work is performed on-site and in person. Based on class schedule Export Compliance Requirement This position requires access to EAR or ITAR controlled technologies. Applicants are required to be eligible for employment under U.S. export control laws and must meet the requirement of being a “U.S. Citizen”. Job Story Ennovar is looking for a SAP Business Systems Analysts to work at Textron Aviation. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Support SAP functional and technical teams across Finance, Supply Chain, Manufacturing, Customer Support, and other business functions. Assist with gathering and documenting business requirements. Help analyze and troubleshoot SAP issues and user access requests. Collaborate with cross-functional teams to understand business processes and identify improvement opportunities. Participate in testing system enhancements, upgrades, and process improvements. Document development objects in accordance with audit requirements. Support project activities, including testing, documentation, and user training. Research SAP functionality and industry best practices to recommend solutions. Use AI and automation tools, including Microsoft Copilot, to improve productivity and streamline repetitive tasks. Required Education High school diploma or equivalent Additional Requirements Interest in SAP systems, enterprise business applications, and business process improvement. Strong analytical and problem-solving skills. Ability to communicate effectively and collaborate with cross-functional teams. Attention to detail when documenting requirements, testing results, and technical information. Willingness to learn SAP functionality and assist with system troubleshooting and user support. Ability to research potential solutions and learn AI and automation tools, including Microsoft Copilot. Additional Information Work is done on site at Textron Aviation West Campus. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) 75463ac1 Last Name (required) 24af3839 Email (required) cad60ed7 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) f0a4290b Last Name (required) 0018d811 Email (required) be83a5ba Job Alert 2716f2d9 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and