    "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/office-student-assistant-wichita-kansas-united-states-15990309-ad79-4bc7-b235-45575f077137": {
      "title": "Office Student Assistant",
      "description": "Office Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States Office Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode Office Student Assistant Student Affairs (College) | Office/Administrative Support, Student Office Student Assistant 499761 Office/Administrative Support Student Department Student Engagement & Belonging Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay 12.00 an hour, up to 20 hours per week Work Schedule ; work is performed on-site and in person. Monday-Friday, hours will be set according to availability Export Compliance Requirement No export control requirement. Job Story The office of Student Engagement & Belonging is looking for a student assistant to work alongside with our administrative staff. This position will assist with front office related tasks, including answering inquires via phone and email, complete projects, and ensure smooth operations. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Required Education High School diploma or equivalent. Enrolled in a minimum of 6 credit hours at Wichita State University. Additional Requirements - Must be enrolled in at least 6 credit hours - Must be in good standing academically with the university Required Experience This is specific to each position and department. See additional requirements and preferences. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) 59e8f985 Last Name (required) 9076dca3 Email (required) bb10aa13 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting 