      "title": "NIAR Composites and Structures Student Assistant",
      "description": "NIAR Composites and Structures Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States NIAR Composites and Structures Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode NIAR Composites and Structures Student Assistant NIAR Institute | Student NIAR Composites and Structures Student Assistant 498649 Student Department NIAR Composites & Structures Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay $15 per hour Work Schedule ; work is performed on-site and in person. Based on class schedule Export Compliance Requirement This position requires access to EAR or ITAR controlled technologies. Applicants are required to be eligible for employment under U.S. export control laws and must meet the requirement of being a “U.S. Citizen”. Job Story The NIAR Composites & Structures lab is looking for a student assistant. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Perform and emphasize mechanical properties data evaluation in advanced materials. Conduct data reduction in accordance with ASTM and non-ASTM standards. Required Education High school diploma or equivalent Additional Requirements Enrolled in Wichita State University STEM Program • Major in Engineering. • Must be an undergraduate student with a GPA above 3.0 • Strong attention to detail • Strong organizational and communication skills • Must be proficient in MS Excel, Word, and Outlook and CATIA • Ability to effectively prioritize and manage work flow based on expectations • Ability to work efficiently both independently and along with other colleagues • Available to work a minimum of 20 hours per week Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) 4cffc59a Last Name (required) 1f9736f6 Email (required) 16f510f3 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 49be254e Last Name (required) f7d1a49e Email (required) 86aa0293 Job Alert 007635f9 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) NIAR Institute NIAR Institute Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With Someone Else! First Name (required) 87d1f350 Last Name (required) b8da02ba Email (required) b30b7615 Send This Job To: cd6292e8 Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy We've sent this job 