      "description": "Accounting and Office Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States Accounting and Office Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode Accounting and Office Student Assistant National Institute Aviation Res | Student Accounting and Office Student Assistant 499722 Student Department The Office of Research Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay $12.50 per hour Work Schedule ; work is performed on-site and in person. Based on class schedule Export Compliance Requirement This position requires access to EAR or ITAR controlled technologies. Applicants are required to be eligible for employment under U.S. export control laws and must meet the requirement of being a “U.S. Citizen”. Job Story The Office of Research is looking for an accounting and office student assistant. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Performs administrative functions in support of accounting, compliance, and communications, within the Office of Research. May assist with maintaining sponsored project records, compiling content for newsletters and providing operational and administrative support for research administration activities. Required Education High school diploma or equivalent Additional Requirements Major in Accounting, Business Administration, Finance, or a related field and completion of at least six credit hours of accounting coursework; or one year of experience in accounting, financial, administrative, or related office support functions. Additional Information Work will be done on site in Jardine Hall. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone,