      "description": "OAL Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States OAL Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode OAL Student Assistant Strategic Enrollment Mgmt | Student OAL Student Assistant 499557 Student Department Online and Adult Learning Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay $8.00 per hour Work Schedule ; work is performed on-site and in person. Flexible around class schedule, Mon-Fri, maybe some evenings and/or weekends. Export Compliance Requirement No export control requirement. Job Story We are looking for an undergraduate student to work about 10-20 hours a week. We put the emphasis on the student & ensure studies come first. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties • Answer phones & email inquiries • Stuff letters to mail to current/prospective students • Assist students with technology issues • Help with events (Scholarship dinner, • Count & maintain supply inventory • Display good customer service skills • Cover office – follow open & closing procedures • Assist staff with light office duties Required Education High School diploma or equivalent. Enrolled in a minimum of 6 credit hours at Wichita State University. Required Experience This is specific to each position and department. See additional requirements and preferences. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) 13c5235f Last Name (required) 260fcd8a Email (required) 240e6a8a Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form a