      "title": "NIAR CAD/CAM Business Analytics Student Assistant",
      "description": "NIAR CAD/CAM Business Analytics Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States NIAR CAD/CAM Business Analytics Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode NIAR CAD/CAM Business Analytics Student Assistant NIAR Institute | Student NIAR CAD/CAM Business Analytics Student Assistant 499312 Student Department NIAR CAD/CAM Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay $15 per hour Work Schedule . Based on class schedule; work is performed on-site and in person. Export Compliance Requirement No export control requirement. Job Story The NIAR CAD/CAM lab is looking for a Business Analytics student assistant. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Provide daily administrative and operational support to the Project Manager and program management team. This role focuses on executing routine tasks, maintaining project records, and coordinating logistics to ensure smooth project operations under the direction of project leadership. Essential Functions Project Support: Assists the Project Manager in tracking task timelines, action items, and upcoming milestone deadlines. Documentation & Records: Prepares and distributes meeting agendas, takes detailed meeting minutes, and organizes digital project files and documentation. Administrative Logistics: Coordinates team calendars, schedules meetings, and processes travel authorizations, expense reports, or purchasing requests. Data Entry & Tracking: Enters and updates project tracking data, task updates, and spreadsheet metrics as directed by the team. Required Education High school diploma or equivalent Preferred Qualifications Excellent oral and written communication skills. Proficient with Microsoft Office Products. 