    "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/firepoint-program-student-assistant-wichita-kansas-united-states": {
      "title": "FirePoint Program Student Assistant",
      "description": "FirePoint Program Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States FirePoint Program Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode FirePoint Program Student Assistant FirePoint Innovations | Student FirePoint Program Student Assistant 499406 Student Department FirePoint Innovations Campus Location Wichita, KS - Other Wichita Location Hire Type Part Time Pay $15 - 19 per hour Work Schedule Based on class schedule Export Compliance Requirement This position requires access to EAR or ITAR controlled technologies. Applicants are required to be eligible for employment under U.S. export control laws and must meet the requirement of being a “U.S. Citizen”. Job Story FirePoint Innovations is looking for a Program Student Assistant. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Assisting in tracking company engagement information and recording notes on detailed discovery calls. Supporting efforts in identifying relevant funding opportunities, solicitations, and challenges for qualified companies we engage with. Dedicated assistance to support event coordination. Updating and populating the Ecosystem calendar with ongoing statewide events for team/partner awareness (Encountering Innovation, Fuse Ventures, etc.). Assisting with research efforts and coordination of the Kansas Defense Coalition. Providing additional support for table/booth presence at local tradeshows, events, and conferences. Contributing to Tasker Projects, particularly those involving data population as assigned by ARI. Researching and identifying companies that align with our Transition Programs. Required Education High school diploma or equivalent Additional Requirements Ideal Candidate Majoring in: Business, Management, Entrepreneurship Communications, Marketing, or PR MIS, Data Analytics, or IT Engineering or STEM fields Must have reliable transportation - Most work will be done from Groover Labs Preferred Qualifications Strong attention to detail Strong written and verbal communication Comfortable working with data and spreadsheets Able to research and summarize information Organized, proactive, and able to work independently Interest in innovation, defense, technology, or government programs is a plus. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) 56848974 Last Name (required) 18a83a2d Email (required) 0cf25b99 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) e501243c Last Name (required) d3ecff90 Email (required) f753234e Job Alert 07d40a00 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) FirePoint Innovations FirePoint Innovations Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying