ion and department. See additional requirements and preferences. Preferred Qualifications Work Study Eligible students needed in the School of Art, Design and Creative Industries office for office coverage and customer service. Office Assistant Students must be available for morning hours. Must have knowledge of Microsoft Excel and Adobe Creative Cloud. Graphic Design experience a plus. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) ffd8d8cd Last Name (required) a710f42e Email (required) 9af1129b Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 0625c570 Last Name (required) cee36d01 Email (required) f1b0a9c8 Job Alert 6e4ca375 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) College of Fine Arts College of Fine Arts Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With S