ploma or equivalent. Enrolled in a minimum of 6 credit hours at Wichita State University. Additional Requirements Must be eligible for Federal Work Study program. Must have dependable transportation as position is not on main campus. This position is not eligible for sponsorship. Required Experience This is specific to each position and department. See additional requirements and preferences. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) c0656460 Last Name (required) 1cd1245f Email (required) 13c517df Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) fa1f8009 Last Name (required) 890b6d86 Email (required) 8ac16997 Job Alert 8b97132e Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) Academic Programs Academic Programs Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With S