    "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/atlas-machining-lab-assistant-wichita-kansas-united-states": {
      "title": "ATLAS Machining Lab Assistant",
      "description": "ATLAS Machining Lab Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States ATLAS Machining Lab Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode ATLAS Machining Lab Assistant NIAR Institute | Student ATLAS Machining Lab Assistant 496571 Student Department NIAR Adv Tech Lab Aerospace Syst Campus Location Wichita, KS - Other Wichita Location Hire Type Part Time Pay $15 - 18 per hour Work Schedule Based on class schedule Export Compliance Requirement No export control requirement. Job Story The NIAR ATLAS lab is looking for a student assistant to help with daily tasks within the lab. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Measuring parts using manual and automated tools. Using shop tools such as bandsaws, drills, impact drivers, angle grinder, etc. Operating CNC machines for the machining of carbon fiber and metallic materials. Required Education High school diploma or equivalent Preferred Qualifications Ability to read blueprints Ability to use precision measuring tools Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phones, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) fb5c55c6 Last Name (required) ae8f7ae4 Email (required) b6d2fbab Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Tha