    "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/student-assistant-wsu-wichita-kansas-united-states-c688bbed-d6da-452f-8e08-8ae035aeead0": {
      "title": "Student Assistant WSU",
      "description": "Student Assistant WSU - Wichita, Kansas, United States Student Assistant WSU - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode Student Assistant WSU Strategic Enrollment Mgmt | Student Student Assistant WSU 498772 Student Department OneStop Shocker Success Center Building Manager Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay $12.00 hr. Work Schedule Hours will vary between Mon - Wed 8am - 7pm ; Thurs 8pm - 9pm ; Friday 8am - 5pm Export Compliance Requirement No export control requirement. Job Story When students, staff and visitors need help finding the right place or person, we need someone reliable, welcoming, and ready to lead. As a Student Assistant Building Manager, you’ll play a key role in keeping the building and its patrons safe and running smoothly while gaining a valuable experience. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Please Note: This is an evening position: Monday – Thursday: 8am – 9pm ; Friday 8am - 5pm • Get familiar with each department in the Shocker Success Center. You should know their location and have an overview of each department’s services. • No student or visitor leaves without being welcomed, asked how we can help, and we should be asking follow-up questions to ensure we are answering their questions. • You will be assigned to host tabling/recruitment events as needed (i.e., Black & Yellow Day & other Informational Events). • May be required to work weekends when necessary. • Be prepared to participate in team building exercises. • Be prepared to give tours of the building. • Be prepared to escort visitors/student to other departments in the building. • Walk the building, doing a check on each floor. • Make note of all things out of place or that need to be repaired and or replaced i.e., blown lights bulbs, tripping hazards, broken fixtures etc. • Make sure the building is clear and/or remind all personnel the building locks at 9:00pm. • Other duties assigned. Required Education High School diploma or equivalent. Enrolled in a minimum of 6 credit hours at Wichita State University. Additional Requirements Must be available to work evenings Monday - Thursday. Required Experience This is specific to each position and department. See additional requirements and preferences. Additional Information SSC building hours: Monday - Wednesday 7am - 7pm Thursday 7am - 9pm Friday 7am - 5pm Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) ecffff27 Last Name (required) 415a8cb2 Email (required) 0e4e0d5b Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) ee39c3fd Last Name (required) 9bf39620 Email (required) daed5a1a Job Alert 0f3da16e Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) Strategic Enrollment Mgmt Strategic Enrollment Mgmt Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available