    "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/advanced-materials-assistant-wichita-kansas-united-states": {
      "title": "Advanced Materials Assistant",
      "description": "Advanced Materials Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States Advanced Materials Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode Advanced Materials Assistant NIAR Institute | Temporary Advanced Materials Assistant 498747 Temporary Department NIAR Composites & Structures - Advanced Materials Research Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay $15 - 18 per hour Work Schedule Based on class schedule Export Compliance Requirement This position requires access to EAR or ITAR controlled technologies. Applicants are required to be eligible for employment under U.S. export control laws and must meet the requirement of being a “U.S. Citizen”. Job Story The Advanced Materials Research group is looking for an assistant interested in pursuing an engineering (or related field) degree. This position will be based in Wichita, KS and will see you work closely with engineers at NIAR to support our growing government and industry customer base. If you are detail oriented, enjoy challenging and rewarding work, and like being part of a team, consider applying for this position. Job Duties This position will focus on learning and supporting all aspects of applied research for various government and industry customers. Projects are focused on characterization and qualification of materials and structures as well as integration into cutting-edge applications. This position will be based in Wichita, KS and will see you work closely with engineers at NIAR to support our growing government and industry customer base. If you are detail oriented, enjoy challenging and rewarding work, and like being part of a team, consider applying for this position. Additional Requirements Ability to work well in a team environment and effectively communicate. Self-motivated Strong organizational and time-management skills. Excellent communication and interpersonal skills. Physical Requirements Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information Apply Now First Name (required) b5ec25d0 Last Name (required) 0aed4887 Email (required) 8956d221 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 54caee2b Last Name (required) be54a631 Email (required) ad846c59 Job Alert 5580781f Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Temporary Temporary Department(s) NIAR Institute NIAR Institute Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With Someone Else! First Name (required) 186f62ce Last Name (required) 6b0f843e Email (required) a3e63543 Send This Job To: 35c18341 Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy We've sent this job to the email provided! Not the right fit? Search all jobs here. Search by job title, location, department, cat