    "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/structural-analysis-student-assistant-wichita-kansas-united-states": {
      "title": "Structural Analysis Student Assistant",
      "description": "Structural Analysis Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States Structural Analysis Student Assistant - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode Structural Analysis Student Assistant NIAR Institute | Student Structural Analysis Student Assistant 497872 Student Department Engineering Design and Mod Team Campus Location Wichita, KS - Other Wichita Location Hire Type Part Time Pay $16 - 22 per hour Work Schedule Based on class schedule Export Compliance Requirement This position requires access to EAR or ITAR controlled technologies. Applicants are required to be eligible for employment under U.S. export control laws and must meet the requirement of being a “U.S. Citizen”. Job Story The NIAR Engineering Design and Mod team is looking for a student assistant to support various diverse program efforts as a structural analysis student assistant. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area in which the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Analysis of airframe structural components using hand analysis and Finite Element Analysis software. Analysis can include static, dynamic, fatigue, and damage tolerance assessment. The structural analysis intern will utilize CAD Modeling software, 2D drawings, and Finite Element Analysis software to perform their tasks. Required Education High school diploma or equivalent Preferred Qualifications Working towards a degree in Mechanical or Aerospace Engineering. Sophomore or higher preferred. Experience and interest in Finite Element Analysis Software. FEMAP, Patran, and NASTRAN preferred. Experience with CAD. (CATIA V5, 3DX, Solidworks). Experience with Microsoft Office (Word, Excel, PowerPoint). Excellent writing and communication skills. Excellent time management and critical thinking skills. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment, including but not limited to phones, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) 8b59f841 Last Name (required) 03a2bebd Email (required) 674cba3e Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 6594b70f Last Name (required) de9ac14f Email (required) 177985c5 Job Alert f2c0d427 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) NIAR Institute NIAR Institute Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With Someone Else! First Name (required) bcad4537 Last Name (required) fbfb8c16 Email (required) ff9b544a Send This Job To: aa2f87f7 Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubs