    "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/paper-grader-yuan-liu-wichita-kansas-united-states-b2f633b0-58e3-429d-a809-4295263c910e": {
      "title": "Paper Grader-Yuan Liu",
      "description": "Paper Grader-Yuan Liu - Wichita, Kansas, United States Paper Grader-Yuan Liu - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Kiosk mode Paper Grader-Yuan Liu College of Liberal Arts & Sciences | Student Paper Grader-Yuan Liu 499868 Student Department Mathematics & Statistics Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay $7.25 per hour Work Schedule ; work is performed on-site and in person. To be determined based on instructor's needs Export Compliance Requirement No export control requirement. Job Story Are you a detail-oriented student with a strong background in mathematics and/or statistics, and the ability to work independently on assigned tasks? The Mathematics and Statistics department is seeking qualified student paper graders for the spring semester 2027. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties This position requires sufficient knowledge in Math 555. Paper graders assist with grading of student course materials. Grading procedures and deadlines are at the discretion of, and supplied by the instructor. Responsibilities include collection of assignments, grading according to guidelines set forth by the instructor, and return of assignments by established deadlines. Applicants should possess a strong background in mathematics and/or statistics, and are expected to exhibit sufficient knowledge required to perform at the course levels for which they are applying. Attention to detail and ability to work independently are a must. Required Education High School diploma or equivalent. Enrolled in a minimum of 6 credit hours at Wichita State University. Additional Requirements Applicants should possess a strong background in mathematics and/or statistics, and are expected to exhibit sufficient knowledge required to perform at the course levels for which they are applying. Attention to detail and ability to work independently are a must. Required Experience This is specific to each position and department. See additional requirements and preferences. Additional Information Applicants need to submit a Resume and Transcript. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) 3b0c9bdc Last Name (required) 9ceec312 Email (required) 8a80b572 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) b0829e9e Last Name (required) 28904354 Email (required) 75060f6a Job Alert 7ea61d3a Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) College of Liberal Arts & Sciences College of Liberal Arts & Sciences Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With Someone Else! First N